  "_comment": [
    "Pinned font corpus for the TS.5 raster/performance fixtures.",
    "This file lists what the fixtures REQUIRE; it is not a list of what is",
    "installed on the machine, and ctest never downloads anything. Run",
    "tools/setup-font-fixtures.sh prepare to fill the cache directory, then",
    "font_fixture_tests renders through these exact bytes. The test re-checks",
    "every sha256 here before it trusts a file: a corpus that quietly became",
    "another face would make every pixel assertion below a lie.",
    "Licence: each family ships under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 and its",
    "own OFL.txt (copyright lines differ per family, so each licence is",
    "pinned too). The fonts are NOT vendored into this repository - see",
    "tests/fixtures/fonts/README.md for the policy note."
